    <note type="translation" xml:lang="en">Ismāʿīl, the Qurʾan reciter, the master of tajwīd, imam of the al-Khawāja Ibrāhīm madrasa in Ṣāliḥiyya, Damascus. He died in Muḥarram of the year 859 H. al-Lubūdī (Ibn al-Lubūdī) chronicled him.</note>
